{"title": "Legendary Action: Fanatic Retaliation", "pageid": 35449, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Fanatic_Retaliation", "categories": ["Honour mode", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"bg3wiki-honour-content-notice\" class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #443E20, #232323); border-radius:10px; max-width: 630px; padding: 5px; width: auto; padding: 4px 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/33px-Honour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/44px-Honour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> This page is about content exclusive to <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Legendary_Action_Fanatic_Retaliation.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Legendary_Action_Fanatic_Retaliation.webp/300px-Legendary_Action_Fanatic_Retaliation.webp, /w/images/3/3d/Legendary_Action_Fanatic_Retaliation.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Legendary_Action_Fanatic_Retaliation.webp/300px-Legendary_Action_Fanatic_Retaliation.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Legendary_Action_Fanatic_Retaliation.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Legendary Action: Fanatic Retaliation</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Passive_feature\" title=\"Passive feature\">passive feature</a> available to <a href=\"/wiki/Kar%27niss\" title=\"Kar'niss\">Kar'niss</a> in Honour mode, which lets him use the legendary action <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fanatic_Retaliation\" title=\"Fanatic Retaliation\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/da/Legendary_Action_Fanatic_Retaliation_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Fanatic_Retaliation_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/da/Legendary_Action_Fanatic_Retaliation_Icon.webp/38px-Legendary_Action_Fanatic_Retaliation_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/da/Legendary_Action_Fanatic_Retaliation_Icon.webp/50px-Legendary_Action_Fanatic_Retaliation_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fanatic Retaliation\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/da/Legendary_Action_Fanatic_Retaliation_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Fanatic_Retaliation_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/da/Legendary_Action_Fanatic_Retaliation_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fanatic_Retaliation\" title=\"Fanatic Retaliation\">Fanatic Retaliation</a> immediately after one of his spindleweb fanatics is killed. He will target the killer.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Once per round when a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spindleweb_Fanatic_(Condition)\" title=\"Spindleweb Fanatic (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Generic_Psychic_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Psychic_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/03/Generic_Psychic_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Psychic_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/03/Generic_Psychic_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Psychic_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Spindleweb Fanatic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Generic_Psychic_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Psychic_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/03/Generic_Psychic_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spindleweb_Fanatic_(Condition)\" title=\"Spindleweb Fanatic (Condition)\">Spindleweb Fanatic</a> is killed, Kar'niss can use a Legendary Action to possibly deal <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">6d10</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span></a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Silenced_(Condition)\" title=\"Silenced (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Silence\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Silenced_(Condition)\" title=\"Silenced (Condition)\">Silence</a> the attacker. \n</p><p><span style=\"color: white;\">Legendary Actions restore at the start of each round.</span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">LegendaryAction_SCL_Drider_PsionicVengeance</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LegendaryAction_SCL_Drider_PsionicVengeance\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LegendaryAction_SCL_Drider_PsionicVengeance\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Legendary_Action:_Fanatic_Retaliation\"> Condition: Legendary Action: Fanatic Retaliation </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Fanatic_Retaliation_(Condition)\" title=\"Legendary Action: Fanatic Retaliation (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Legendary_Action_Fanatic_Retaliation_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Fanatic_Retaliation_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Legendary_Action_Fanatic_Retaliation_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Legendary_Action_Fanatic_Retaliation_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Legendary_Action_Fanatic_Retaliation_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Legendary_Action_Fanatic_Retaliation_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Legendary Action: Fanatic Retaliation\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Legendary_Action_Fanatic_Retaliation_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Fanatic_Retaliation_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Legendary_Action_Fanatic_Retaliation_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Fanatic_Retaliation_(Condition)\" title=\"Legendary Action: Fanatic Retaliation (Condition)\">Legendary Action: Fanatic Retaliation</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>When an enemy kills a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spindleweb_Fanatic_(Condition)\" title=\"Spindleweb Fanatic (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Generic_Psychic_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Psychic_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/03/Generic_Psychic_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Psychic_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/03/Generic_Psychic_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Psychic_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Spindleweb Fanatic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Generic_Psychic_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Psychic_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/03/Generic_Psychic_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spindleweb_Fanatic_(Condition)\" title=\"Spindleweb Fanatic (Condition)\">Spindleweb Fanatic</a>, Kar'niss will immediately <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fanatic_Retaliation\" title=\"Fanatic Retaliation\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/da/Legendary_Action_Fanatic_Retaliation_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Fanatic_Retaliation_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/da/Legendary_Action_Fanatic_Retaliation_Icon.webp/38px-Legendary_Action_Fanatic_Retaliation_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/da/Legendary_Action_Fanatic_Retaliation_Icon.webp/50px-Legendary_Action_Fanatic_Retaliation_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Retaliate\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/da/Legendary_Action_Fanatic_Retaliation_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Fanatic_Retaliation_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/da/Legendary_Action_Fanatic_Retaliation_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fanatic_Retaliation\" title=\"Fanatic Retaliation\">Retaliate</a> against the attacker.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Kar%27niss\" title=\"Kar'niss\">Kar'niss</a></li></ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714234516\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.058 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.065 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1921/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 21299/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7740/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 24/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expa